<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hershey Foods upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hershey Foods upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette analyst William Leach said he upgraded Hershey Foods Corp on Monday to market perform from underperform.</p>
<p>-- Since November 1996, Leach said, Hershey's share price has declined about 20 percent and has unperformed the stock market by about 30 percent.</p>
<p>-- Hershey shares were up 1/2 at 43-3/4.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
